{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Devasabha (1st)","html":"<article id='thag1.89'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.89 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.89 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Navamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Nine </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>(Paṭhama) Devasabhattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Devasabha (1st) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Uttiṇṇā paṅkapalipā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ve crossed the bogs, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>pātālā parivajjitā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ve avoided the chasms, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Mutto oghā ca ganthā ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’m freed from floods and ties, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbe mānā visaṁhatā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and I’ve wiped out all conceit. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Devasabho thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
